Error [E0003]: A positional enum variant can carry only one value
  --> tests/ui/enum_multi_positional_payload.jet:2:15
    |
  2 |     Hit(String, Int)
    |               ^
 Why: One positional payload has one type; variants with two or more values use named fields
 Fix: Name each field, for example `Hit(text: String, count: Int)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
